        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Thuanku dikho poubaumei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Thuanku dikho poubaumei thuaihian liangmei,",
            "Ka jaujian hei rui kan lou na;",
            "Rianra theimei khou rui aniu ta kanlou,",
            "Ntao hei aniu gaina ariu dat the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He thuan dikho ‘niu kanloumei puta,",
            "Kabang karu thang tat man kanmei guai,",
            "Man mak nga aniu ariu dat the poubaumei jan khou,",
            "Thuan pui khuan rui kao kho halleluijah.",
            "",
            "2. Nchummei Guang poubaumei khumngai luai the,",
            "Neila pui tan guai ni luai the;",
            "Hei kumma aniu ni tat man ngam khuan the,",
            "Ching le njang kandih khou lung lik khuan the.",
            "",
            "3. Welcome bam khou hei aniu ariu dat the,",
            "Abanjat hei rui ham guang e;",
            "Khrista poubaumei khou neila lou ngam o,",
            "Sangai pui tingmik ge pou khrista jan khou.",
            "",
            "4. Neila janggai mei 3)_ kathan pat dat diu,",
            "Lung le bumang jip thao dat na;",
            "Aniu khang rui kapmei le rianra kanmei,",
            "Guang Khrista thunku khang kathan sudat diu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
